#: ../../source/index.rst:6
msgid "cuTile Python"
msgstr "cuTile Python"

#: ../../source/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"cuTile is a parallel programming model for NVIDIA GPUs and a Python-based"
" :abbr:`DSL (Domain-Specific Language)`. It automatically leverages "
"advanced hardware capabilities, such as tensor cores and tensor memory "
"accelerators, while providing portability across different NVIDIA GPU "
"architectures. cuTile enables the latest hardware features without "
"requiring code changes."
msgstr ""
"cuTile 是面向 NVIDIA GPU 的并行编程模型，也是一种基于 Python 的 :abbr:`DSL (Domain-Specific"
" Language，领域特定语言)`。它能够自动利用张量核心（Tensor Cores）和张量内存加速器（Tensor Memory "
"Accelerator）等先进硬件能力，同时在不同 NVIDIA GPU 架构之间提供良好的可移植性。使用 "
"cuTile，无需修改代码即可启用最新硬件特性。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:13
msgid ""
"cuTile |kernels| are GPU programs that are executed in parallel on a "
"logical |grid| of |blocks|. The :py:class:`@ct.kernel <cuda.tile.kernel>`"
" decorator marks a Python function as a kernel's entry point. Kernels "
"cannot be called directly from the host code; the host must queue kernels"
" for execution on GPU using the :py:func:`ct.launch() <cuda.tile.launch>`"
" function:"
msgstr ""
"cuTile |kernels| 是在由 |blocks| 组成的逻辑 |grid| 上并行执行的 GPU 程序。 "
":py:class:`@ct.kernel <cuda.tile.kernel>` 装饰器将 Python "
"函数标记为内核的入口点。内核不能直接从主机代码中调用；主机必须使用 :py:func:`ct.launch() "
"<cuda.tile.launch>` 函数将内核加入队列以在 GPU 上执行："

#: ../../source/index.rst:58
msgid ""
"|Kernels| move data between |arrays| and |tiles| using functions like "
":py:func:`ct.load() <cuda.tile.load>` and :py:func:`ct.store() "
"<cuda.tile.store>`. Both arrays and tiles are tensor-like data "
"structures: each has a specific shape (i.e., the number of elements along"
" each axis) and a |dtype| (i.e., the data type of elements). However, "
"there are important differences:"
msgstr ""
"|Kernels| 使用 :py:func:`ct.load() <cuda.tile.load>` 和 :py:func:`ct.store()"
" <cuda.tile.store>` 等函数在 |arrays| 与 |tiles| 之间搬运数据。数组和 Tile "
"都是类似张量的数据结构：各自都有特定的形状（即沿每个轴的元素数量）和 |dtype| （即元素的数据类型）。不过，二者之间存在重要区别："

#: ../../source/index.rst:64
msgid ""
"|Arrays| are stored in the global memory. They are mutable and have "
"physical, strided memory layouts. Within the kernel code, they support "
"only a limited set of operations, mostly related to |loading and storing|"
" data to/from tiles. Various Python objects, including PyTorch tensors "
"and CuPy arrays, can be passed as arrays from the host code to the kernel"
" via kernel arguments."
msgstr ""
"|Arrays| "
"存储在全局内存中。它们是可变的，并具有物理跨步（strided）内存布局。在内核代码中，数组仅支持有限的一组操作，主要涉及将数据与 Tile "
"之间进行 |loading and storing| 。多种 Python 对象（包括 PyTorch 张量和 CuPy "
"数组）都可以作为内核参数从主机代码以数组形式传递给内核。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:70
msgid ""
"|Tiles| are immutable values without defined storage that only exist in "
"the kernel code. Tile dimensions must be compile-time constants that are "
"powers of two. Tiles support a multitude of |operations|, including "
"elementwise arithmetic, matrix multiplication, reduction, shape "
"manipulation, etc."
msgstr ""
"|Tiles| 是仅存在于内核代码中的不可变值，没有固定的存储位置。Tile 的各维度尺寸必须是 2 的幂且为编译期常量。Tile 支持丰富的 "
"|operations| ，包括逐元素算术、矩阵乘法、归约、形状变换等。"

